  "pair": "ja-en",
  "title": "私も監督の作品に出たいです  (I Want To Appear in the Director's Films Too)",
  "level": "A1 — beginner",
  "labels": {
    "editor": "編集者",
    "kuroki": "黒木",
    "reika": "麗華"
  },
  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "In her television dressing room, Kuroki hears how busy Muranishi's crew has become and confides to stylist Reika that she wants to film with him again, before dazzling a live studio crowd.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "kuroki",
      "t": "監督の作品、話題になってるんですね。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "reika",
      "t": "うん、結構売れてるみたい。こっちはヘトヘトだけど。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "reika",
      "t": "次は私が監督やるの。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kuroki",
      "t": "楽しそう。私も監督の作品に出たいです。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "reika",
      "t": "オーケー！きれいだよ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "reika",
      "t": "じゃ、私次の現場あるから先に出るね。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kuroki",
      "t": "ありがとうございました。お疲れさまです。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "editor",
      "t": "黒木さんは一躍人気ですけど、撮影現場はどういう感じなんですか？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kuroki",
      "t": "撮影の時には時間と空間の観念が消失してしまいます。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kuroki",
      "t": "皆様、どうぞとくとご覧くださいませ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kuroki",
      "t": "今日は出血大サービスです。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "editor",
      "t": "いやあ、今日の会場は一段とウケるね。",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "kuroki",
      "t": "監督の作品、話題になってるんですね。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'The director's new films have become the talk of the town, haven't they.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "reika",
      "t": "うん、結構売れてるみたい。こっちはヘトヘトだけど。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Yeah, they seem to be selling really well, though we are exhausted.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "reika",
      "t": "次は私が監督やるの。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Next up, it is my turn to direct.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kuroki",
      "t": "楽しそう。私も監督の作品に出たいです。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'That sounds so fun. I want to appear in the director's films again too.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "reika",
      "t": "オーケー！きれいだよ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'All done! You look gorgeous.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "reika",
      "t": "じゃ、私次の現場あるから先に出るね。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Well, I have another shoot next, so I will head out first.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kuroki",
      "t": "ありがとうございました。お疲れさまです。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Thank you so much. Keep up the great work.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "editor",
      "t": "黒木さんは一躍人気ですけど、撮影現場はどういう感じなんですか？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'You shot to stardom overnight—what does it feel like on a film set?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kuroki",
      "t": "撮影の時には時間と空間の観念が消失してしまいます。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'When I am filming, all sense of time and space vanishes completely.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kuroki",
      "t": "皆様、どうぞとくとご覧くださいませ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Everyone, please take a good, close look.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kuroki",
      "t": "今日は出血大サービスです。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Today is a special treat on the house.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "editor",
      "t": "いやあ、今日の会場は一段とウケるね。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Wow, today's studio crowd is loving every second of this.'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
    {
